WEBVTT

01:40.870 --> 01:45.830
[Love in Pavilion]

01:46.210 --> 01:50.820
[Episode 31]

02:02.400 --> 02:03.200
Huaizhu.

02:05.840 --> 02:07.310
Maybe you shouldn't go to

02:07.560 --> 02:08.820
the Tushan Grief Tree.

02:09.360 --> 02:10.150
Why?

02:12.430 --> 02:14.120
Breaching the Boundary to slay the Black Fox,

02:14.120 --> 02:15.320
I can handle it alone.

02:33.190 --> 02:34.240
Tushan Yaya said

02:35.630 --> 02:37.030
the Twilight Mist Flower

02:37.240 --> 02:40.100
has deeply penetrated your spirit
and bone marrow.

02:40.290 --> 02:41.890
If you forcefully summon it,

02:41.920 --> 02:44.180
it will cause great damage to your body.

02:44.820 --> 02:47.280
Your skills will never be the same
as before,

02:48.310 --> 02:50.079
and even your lifelong cultivation

02:50.079 --> 02:51.480
will no longer progress.

02:53.430 --> 02:55.090
I can't let that happen to you.

02:58.430 --> 02:59.150
Hongye,

03:00.840 --> 03:02.120
you have your mission,

03:02.870 --> 03:04.730
and I have things I must do as well.

03:05.150 --> 03:06.410
But your condition...

03:06.750 --> 03:07.870
Regarding this,

03:08.520 --> 03:09.780
I'm not worried at all.

03:10.960 --> 03:12.820
Because even if my skills weaken,

03:13.560 --> 03:14.960
I still have you, don't I?

03:15.430 --> 03:16.560
You will protect me.

03:22.240 --> 03:23.360
It's almost time.

03:24.120 --> 03:26.360
We don't want to be late for the last gathering
with the Mask Group

03:26.360 --> 03:28.160
before breaching the Boundary.

03:35.840 --> 03:39.900
I am Li Quzhuo, the second young master of
the Li family from Peach Garden.

03:40.240 --> 03:41.430
Be careful.

03:41.520 --> 03:41.910
You...

03:41.910 --> 03:42.280
Qiyue.

03:42.280 --> 03:43.630
I just finished cleaning here.

03:43.630 --> 03:44.560
Quzhuo.

03:44.840 --> 03:46.079
Stop messing around, Quzhuo.

03:46.079 --> 03:47.030
Clean properly.

03:47.150 --> 03:49.120
It's all because you haven't made
the cleaning talisman yet.

03:49.120 --> 03:51.520
You've managed to make the
cleaning weapon,

03:51.520 --> 03:52.400
but look

03:52.420 --> 03:54.620
what you've done to the table legs here.

03:56.150 --> 03:56.750
What's going on?

03:56.750 --> 03:57.590
Why so dusty?

03:59.030 --> 03:59.750
Zizai.

04:00.710 --> 04:01.720
Quzhuo.

04:03.040 --> 04:03.870
Qiyue.

04:04.240 --> 04:05.630
I'll say it again.

04:05.630 --> 04:06.890
Call me Sixth Brother.

04:09.090 --> 04:11.310
Zizai, I'll play Go with you.

04:11.430 --> 04:12.080
Take this!

04:13.310 --> 04:14.120
Watch me!

04:18.190 --> 04:18.990
Try this move!

04:20.089 --> 04:21.079
How's this move?

04:22.720 --> 04:24.630
Quzhuo, where's my Yitan?

04:24.630 --> 04:26.240
Call me Fourth Brother, not Quzhuo, okay?

04:26.240 --> 04:28.300
He's helping me with some hard labor.

04:28.720 --> 04:30.580
Qiyue, Quzhuo, come out and help.

04:30.630 --> 04:31.270
Coming!

04:32.040 --> 04:33.040
Qingmu.

04:33.040 --> 04:35.640
Why are you making my Yitan
do hard labor again?

04:35.750 --> 04:37.390
Where's your Classmate Zhang?

04:37.390 --> 04:39.040
He has some family matters to
attend to today.

04:39.040 --> 04:41.170
That's why I had to trouble your Yitan.

04:41.570 --> 04:43.810
You really do care about him, don't you?

04:44.720 --> 04:45.860
Miss Qingmu.

04:45.920 --> 04:47.120
You're doing such successful business

04:47.120 --> 04:48.510
and rolling in money.

04:49.010 --> 04:51.630
From now on, all our gatherings should be
up to this standard.

04:51.630 --> 04:53.220
That depends on my mood.

04:53.720 --> 04:56.340
But if you behave well,

04:56.750 --> 04:59.070
there might be more when we
return from the Boundary.

04:59.070 --> 04:59.630
Alright.

05:00.000 --> 05:01.360
Then for everyone's sake,

05:01.360 --> 05:04.440
Qiyue and I will take good
care of you today.

05:05.560 --> 05:06.820
Call me Sixth Brother.

05:07.060 --> 05:08.460
Alright, Sixth Brother.

05:08.630 --> 05:09.630
Is everyone here?

05:16.040 --> 05:19.070
Welcome, Mr. and Mrs. Wangquan.

05:29.190 --> 05:31.600
These are all the fine wines carefully selected
by my Ruyi Pavilion.

05:31.600 --> 05:33.040
Let's finish them all today.

05:33.040 --> 05:33.800
Come on.

05:33.800 --> 05:35.600
Let's get smashed tonight.

05:35.600 --> 05:37.310
Alright, let's drink to our
heart's content tonight.

05:37.310 --> 05:37.840
Alright.

05:37.870 --> 05:38.330
Come on.

05:38.510 --> 05:39.310
Let's drink to our heart's content!

05:39.310 --> 05:39.830
Let's drink to our heart's content!

05:39.830 --> 05:40.310
Come on.

05:40.310 --> 05:41.560
Cheers!

05:57.950 --> 05:58.600
Hongye.

05:58.950 --> 06:02.550
You haven't assigned us our parts in
breaching the Boundary yet.

06:03.390 --> 06:04.970
I want to be on the front lines.

06:04.970 --> 06:06.350
You wish.

06:06.450 --> 06:07.180
You...

06:18.210 --> 06:21.540
Puppy Li, shut your mouth.

06:22.120 --> 06:25.380
Only Dongfang Qinlan can call me Puppy Li.

06:30.230 --> 06:32.990
Puppy Li! Puppy Li! Puppy Li!

06:33.070 --> 06:34.750
Lightweight! Lightweight! Lightweight!

06:34.750 --> 06:36.190
You wanna go outside and fight?

06:36.190 --> 06:37.050
Give me a break.

06:40.830 --> 06:41.750
Boring.

06:44.860 --> 06:45.890
Hongye, Huaizhu.

06:47.600 --> 06:49.130
I'd like to toast you again.

06:57.360 --> 06:58.159
I'm not drunk.

06:59.070 --> 07:01.070
I'll drink at your wedding.

07:02.410 --> 07:03.890
At your wedding banquet,

07:05.430 --> 07:06.960
I must sit at the main table.

07:07.490 --> 07:08.890
How disrespectful.

07:09.000 --> 07:10.360
We're all older than you.

07:10.360 --> 07:11.720
You won't get to sit at the
main table, okay?

07:11.720 --> 07:13.390
Can you hold your liquor so well as to
sit at the main table?

07:13.390 --> 07:15.190
If it weren't for me,

07:15.190 --> 07:16.950
would Hongye and Huaizhu
still be together?

07:16.950 --> 07:18.160
Do you know how much I've sacrificed

07:18.160 --> 07:18.870
to protect

07:18.870 --> 07:20.930
Hongye and Huaizhu's relationship?

07:21.310 --> 07:21.770
Look...

07:22.510 --> 07:23.600
Look at this.

07:24.680 --> 07:26.430
Qinlan almost crippled

07:26.430 --> 07:28.050
my dog l-leg, you know?

07:29.270 --> 07:30.240
Come on, let's drink.

07:30.240 --> 07:30.920
Drink up.

07:30.950 --> 07:32.270
Quzhuo has a point.

07:32.870 --> 07:34.260
Come on, sit.

07:34.600 --> 07:36.610
Sit down and stop talking nonsense.

07:36.800 --> 07:38.260
Huaizhu said I had a point.

07:38.720 --> 07:39.430
Right.

07:39.780 --> 07:41.930
Quzhuo has indeed been of great help

07:42.000 --> 07:43.590
to my relationship with Huaizhu.

07:43.590 --> 07:45.040
When we get married,

07:45.390 --> 07:47.590
I'll make sure you sit at the main table.

07:48.040 --> 07:49.800
I can sit at the main table,

07:51.250 --> 07:52.810
but Qinlan can't.

07:53.820 --> 07:56.060
She has to call me Brother Quzhuo.

07:56.090 --> 07:57.510
Then I'll let her sit there.

07:57.510 --> 07:58.980
Disgusting.

08:00.920 --> 08:02.390
Huaizhu.

08:03.750 --> 08:05.190
Please teach me

08:05.600 --> 08:08.390
how to make my Zheng

08:08.390 --> 08:10.600
as proactive as Hongye.

08:11.360 --> 08:12.560
You have no idea...

08:13.040 --> 08:14.160
Look at me.

08:14.830 --> 08:17.750
Do you know how proactive
Hongye was back then?

08:17.750 --> 08:21.390
He was always asking me about you,

08:21.390 --> 08:22.240
and he asked me

08:22.240 --> 08:24.270
to prepare so many things for you,

08:24.270 --> 08:25.120
making all kinds of gifts for you.

08:25.120 --> 08:26.240
Come on, Yuan.

08:26.720 --> 08:27.720
Drink some water.

08:27.950 --> 08:28.950
Drink some water.

08:30.510 --> 08:32.000
What's this for?

08:32.000 --> 08:33.669
I'm not drunk at all.

08:36.080 --> 08:37.510
Anyway,

08:37.510 --> 08:39.150
Zhang Zheng

08:39.150 --> 08:42.510
will never escape from my grasp
in this lifetime.

08:46.670 --> 08:49.840
[Grand Master's Hall]

08:52.440 --> 08:55.790
Look, the moon is so beautiful tonight.

08:58.600 --> 08:59.320
Tonight,

09:01.960 --> 09:03.360
I only want to look at you.

09:25.030 --> 09:26.760
You're the leader of the group,

09:28.240 --> 09:31.450
yet you're going to breach the Boundary alone
without telling anyone.

09:31.450 --> 09:33.780
Are you trying to be a hero all by yourself?

09:37.000 --> 09:38.460
You've even noticed this?

09:40.630 --> 09:41.440
Indeed,

09:42.080 --> 09:43.790
nothing escapes your eyes.

09:52.510 --> 09:54.240
Breaching the Boundary alone,

09:55.550 --> 09:57.550
you must take good care of yourself.

10:02.510 --> 10:04.310
Your journey to Tushan this time

10:04.630 --> 10:07.230
will definitely take a great toll
on your body.

10:07.720 --> 10:09.270
I've already asked Mr. Fei

10:09.510 --> 10:11.910
to prepare herbs for energy replenishing
and health restoring.

10:11.910 --> 10:12.550
Remember

10:13.150 --> 10:14.950
to have Qinlan come and get them.

10:22.000 --> 10:23.270
Zhang Zheng.

10:39.600 --> 10:40.320
Quzhuo.

10:41.630 --> 10:42.640
What is it?

10:44.670 --> 10:46.600
I've saved up over 1,000 talismans

10:47.060 --> 10:48.920
and put them under your bed frame.

10:53.560 --> 10:56.360
Are you entrusting your legacy to me
or something?

10:56.720 --> 10:59.440
Are you entrusting your thousand-plus talismans
to me

10:59.440 --> 11:01.360
or entrusting me to your
thousand-plus talismans?

11:01.360 --> 11:03.420
What nonsense are you talking about?

11:04.960 --> 11:06.670
If you dare to die before me,

11:06.670 --> 11:08.600
I'll burn all your talismans.

11:10.360 --> 11:13.160
You're really acting like a puppy now,
aren't you?

11:16.670 --> 11:20.470
I'm telling you, there are even people
calling me "Dog Brother" now.

11:20.720 --> 11:21.980
I'm quite formidable.

11:22.970 --> 11:24.570
I'll protect you from now on.

11:29.120 --> 11:31.270
I believe I saw a sachet

11:31.270 --> 11:32.470
under your bed frame.

11:33.550 --> 11:34.460
Who is it for?

11:34.910 --> 11:37.080
I remember before you came here,

11:37.080 --> 11:39.540
you must have looked at it at least
800 times.

11:46.120 --> 11:47.000
Tell me,

11:47.030 --> 11:48.060
who is she?

11:48.190 --> 11:49.520
Mind your own business.

11:49.820 --> 11:51.000
Hey, is she beautiful?

11:51.000 --> 11:51.720
When will you bring her back for...

11:51.720 --> 11:52.390
I'm sleepy.

11:52.440 --> 11:53.630
Let me take a look and
check her out for you.

11:53.630 --> 11:54.270
Go to sleep.

11:54.270 --> 11:55.730
Let me take a look, come on.

11:56.960 --> 11:57.870
Yitan.

11:58.510 --> 12:01.270
Why do you think my alcohol tolerance
is so poor?

12:02.320 --> 12:04.120
Could it be because

12:04.120 --> 12:07.780
my parents put the character "zui", which means drunk,
in my name?

12:08.800 --> 12:12.330
The "Zui" in your name refers to
"intoxicated by the east wind,"

12:12.410 --> 12:14.670
not "drunk after three glasses of wine."

12:16.830 --> 12:18.300
You old pedant.

12:22.810 --> 12:23.620
Look.

12:32.150 --> 12:33.410
Let me put it on for you.

12:38.290 --> 12:39.640
I'll put it on for you too.

12:39.640 --> 12:40.210
Alright.

13:01.330 --> 13:02.520
December 5th.

13:03.630 --> 13:05.690
Our wedding date remains unchanged.

13:06.240 --> 13:07.550
After we come back,

13:08.730 --> 13:09.790
we'll get married.

13:15.200 --> 13:16.120
Okay.

13:21.840 --> 13:22.980
Yitan.

13:24.740 --> 13:25.940
Do you

13:26.910 --> 13:29.290
prefer a son

13:29.390 --> 13:30.910
or a daughter?

13:36.670 --> 13:38.430
I want a

13:38.450 --> 13:41.860
soft and sweet daughter like Qiyue's.

13:42.000 --> 13:44.870
It would be even better
if she looked like you.

13:50.470 --> 13:52.060
A daughter who looks like you,

13:52.060 --> 13:53.540
or a son who looks like me.

13:54.230 --> 13:55.990
Good-looking,

13:57.360 --> 13:59.020
with good alcohol tolerance.

14:00.150 --> 14:02.080
Let's have them outdrink Huaizhu.

14:04.120 --> 14:05.440
I really hope

14:06.440 --> 14:08.840
that after this mission,

14:11.270 --> 14:14.120
we won't have to take any more risks.

14:27.090 --> 14:28.540
I'm sure about that.

14:35.520 --> 14:37.710
The one I love?

14:37.750 --> 14:39.150
When I was little,

14:39.170 --> 14:40.680
I had a childhood friend.

14:40.710 --> 14:42.360
He was really good at painting.

14:42.360 --> 14:44.220
So later, I also learned to paint.

14:44.970 --> 14:46.630
♪ Like a dream, like reality, like a fantasy ♪

14:46.060 --> 14:47.620
I'm learning to paint now.

14:47.190 --> 14:49.350
♪ At dawn and dusk ♪

14:47.890 --> 14:49.880
If I give you back your sachet,

14:50.510 --> 14:51.960
will you hit me?

14:51.650 --> 14:53.290
♪ One person, one glance, one instant ♪

14:53.500 --> 14:55.030
Zhang Zheng.

14:53.810 --> 14:56.000
♪ Stop time in the beginning ♪

14:56.720 --> 14:59.310
Why don't you wear white anymore?

14:57.280 --> 14:59.140
♪ Time interlaces or somersaults ♪

15:00.520 --> 15:05.170
You look best in white.

15:00.600 --> 15:03.250
♪ Despite ups and downs, I'll never let you down ♪

15:04.200 --> 15:08.230
♪ Follow the shadow and look out for each other in the clouds ♪

15:10.170 --> 15:11.450
My dear Jiuru.

15:10.830 --> 15:12.540
♪ There's infatuation, there's love, there's hate ♪

15:12.840 --> 15:15.370
I've finally finished carving a full
set of weapons for you.

15:12.910 --> 15:15.800
♪ Lies are hard to understand ♪

15:16.510 --> 15:17.910
When I return from the Boundary,

15:17.160 --> 15:19.020
♪ We won't argue ♪

15:18.210 --> 15:19.490
I'll let you know that

15:19.540 --> 15:22.020
♪ Faintly reflecting the beginning ♪

15:21.260 --> 15:23.920
I'm not just a father who can carry his daughter
on his shoulders.

15:22.980 --> 15:25.330
♪ Burn out the chains of darkness ♪

15:25.800 --> 15:26.730
I'm also

15:26.400 --> 15:29.150
♪ In this life, I will do all to face it with you ♪

15:28.200 --> 15:29.720
a great hero.

15:29.810 --> 15:33.950
♪ Having agreed to grow old together, we now head home ♪

15:33.720 --> 15:35.380
I'll wait for you to come back.

15:35.920 --> 15:37.670
♪ The long-cherished wish of this lifetime ♪

15:36.960 --> 15:40.390
We still have so many things to do together.

15:37.920 --> 15:39.540
♪ The meaning of the world ♪

15:39.950 --> 15:42.780
♪ Follow the light, changing with the stars ♪

15:40.600 --> 15:41.930
Wait for me to come back.

15:43.210 --> 15:45.970
♪ No regrets about my fate; resolute joy ♪

15:46.430 --> 15:49.570
♪ To search for the edge of the world ♪

15:50.030 --> 15:52.380
♪ Born of affection, sustained by love ♪

15:53.060 --> 15:55.440
♪ Our vows will never fade ♪

15:55.940 --> 16:00.730
♪ My heart will never change ♪

16:02.890 --> 16:09.720
♪ My heart remains bright for you ♪

16:45.810 --> 16:48.410
[Western Border, Gateway of Yiqi Alliance]

17:12.790 --> 17:13.790
Elder of Tianmen.

17:13.790 --> 17:15.109
A human with strong magic power

17:15.109 --> 17:16.589
is approaching from behind.

17:16.589 --> 17:19.520
They're moving very fast, and their intentions
are unclear.

17:19.520 --> 17:21.790
[Gatekeeper, Gateway of Yiqi Alliance]

17:24.589 --> 17:26.520
Our border gateway

17:27.240 --> 17:30.510
is not exactly a place of
peace and prosperity.

17:31.400 --> 17:35.750
For many years, no one has come to visit.

17:35.750 --> 17:37.350
This old man would like to see

17:38.460 --> 17:41.110
which noble family this person is from

17:41.680 --> 17:43.650
to have such courage.

17:57.240 --> 17:59.540
It turns out to be a young man.

17:59.800 --> 18:02.320
Strong in magic power and wearing a mask.

18:02.630 --> 18:05.670
This means he's unbound by identity,

18:05.700 --> 18:08.360
coming with the determination
to break taboos.

18:09.360 --> 18:10.480
What a pity.

18:10.750 --> 18:11.440
Today,

18:11.440 --> 18:13.700
I'll teach him that

18:14.070 --> 18:19.270
there are unbreakable rules in this world.

18:20.200 --> 18:24.990
[Heaven]

18:34.440 --> 18:35.510
The Tianmen Spell.

18:35.980 --> 18:39.390
The frontier has walls as high as mountains,

18:39.620 --> 18:43.070
three feet and three inches from the sky.

18:43.880 --> 18:44.720
That's right.

18:45.350 --> 18:46.790
This is

18:46.920 --> 18:48.640
the result of my life's work,

18:48.720 --> 18:51.550
my ultimate magical artifact,

18:51.550 --> 18:52.790
the Tianmen Spell.

18:53.960 --> 18:56.550
Young man, you seem to have some knowledge.

18:57.160 --> 18:58.720
Tell me,

18:59.310 --> 19:02.290
what brings you here?

19:02.770 --> 19:04.700
I just want to leave here for a walk.

19:04.880 --> 19:05.920
I hope you, Elder,

19:06.560 --> 19:07.360
will allow it.

19:07.920 --> 19:09.040
Little one.

19:09.240 --> 19:11.790
This is a restricted area.

19:12.030 --> 19:15.400
Consider this the end of the universe

19:16.270 --> 19:17.000
and go back.

19:18.200 --> 19:19.160
Time is tight,

19:19.960 --> 19:21.560
and I don't intend to linger.

19:22.010 --> 19:23.830
I hope you can accommodate me, Elder.

19:23.830 --> 19:27.110
The mysteries of the universe are infinite.

19:27.640 --> 19:30.310
We should all maintain a sense of awe.

19:31.240 --> 19:32.150
Little one,

19:32.880 --> 19:34.590
you should turn back.

19:58.240 --> 20:00.890
Young man, you seem to have
quite a background.

20:01.400 --> 20:04.110
What is your true identity?

20:04.720 --> 20:05.880
His true identity

20:05.880 --> 20:07.390
is our Mask Group Leader.

20:16.730 --> 20:17.450
Hongye.

20:18.710 --> 20:21.200
Where are you sneaking off to alone?

20:21.680 --> 20:23.110
You thought we wouldn't know that

20:23.110 --> 20:24.870
you drugged our drinks?

20:25.270 --> 20:28.270
Hongye, our acting was pretty convincing,
wasn't it?

20:28.440 --> 20:30.440
To avoid you

20:30.440 --> 20:31.370
fussing over us,

20:31.400 --> 20:33.960
we chose to show up directly.

20:42.400 --> 20:43.880
Who are you people?

20:45.920 --> 20:46.870
Everyone,

20:47.370 --> 20:49.540
let's introduce ourselves!

20:49.960 --> 20:52.160
I'm the Three Perceptions Divine Lord,

20:52.160 --> 20:54.520
second in the Mask Group.

20:54.590 --> 20:56.340
I'm the Unfixed Blade Monarch,

20:56.510 --> 20:58.680
third in the Mask Group.

20:58.790 --> 21:00.790
I'm the Thousand Mechanisms Child,

21:00.920 --> 21:02.680
fourth in the Mask Group.

21:02.790 --> 21:04.490
I'm the Wondrous Jade Immortal,

21:04.490 --> 21:05.710
fifth in the Mask Group.

21:05.710 --> 21:07.510
I'm the Immovable Earth Treasury,

21:07.510 --> 21:09.240
sixth in the Mask Group.

21:09.300 --> 21:11.510
I'm the Illusory Dream Swordswoman,

21:11.590 --> 21:13.830
Qiyue, seventh in the Mask Group.

21:15.270 --> 21:17.270
You seem to have forgotten about me.

21:17.950 --> 21:19.230
I'm the Dark Sword,

21:20.550 --> 21:21.950
eighth in the Mask Group.

21:24.240 --> 21:25.540
I'm the Sword Master,

21:26.580 --> 21:27.980
leader of the Mask Group.

21:29.590 --> 21:31.450
I hope you will let us pass, Elder,

21:31.730 --> 21:32.840
and allow us

21:33.400 --> 21:34.830
to face the real world.

21:35.830 --> 21:37.550
Ignorant and impulsive.

21:38.440 --> 21:41.010
Do you know what exactly

21:41.260 --> 21:42.950
lies beyond the Tianmen Pass?

21:43.350 --> 21:46.350
Forsaking emotions, pursuing hatred; eternal night befalls.

21:46.350 --> 21:47.510
We already know

21:47.660 --> 21:49.070
that beyond this end,

21:49.310 --> 21:51.210
there is a darkness that has been stirring,

21:51.210 --> 21:53.070
wanting to devour everything.

21:53.370 --> 21:55.920
And we are prepared

21:56.160 --> 21:57.650
to tear it apart.

21:57.720 --> 21:58.720
You young people

21:59.480 --> 22:01.540
have no idea of your own limitations.

22:01.750 --> 22:03.110
Go back while you still can,

22:03.110 --> 22:06.750
and forget everything you've seen here.

22:06.790 --> 22:08.110
The truth out there

22:08.880 --> 22:11.200
is more than you could bear.

22:12.590 --> 22:13.850
Since that's the case,

22:14.200 --> 22:15.800
I apologize for any offense.

22:55.480 --> 22:56.530
You...

22:57.650 --> 23:01.580
You actually broke through my Tianmen Formation
with a single strike.

23:01.830 --> 23:04.030
Whose descendants are you?

23:22.550 --> 23:23.200
Elder.

23:23.680 --> 23:25.750
We have been wandering in this world
for many years.

23:25.750 --> 23:27.920
Our determination to end the Eternal Night

23:27.920 --> 23:30.110
is no less than those guarding this gate.

23:30.110 --> 23:31.260
Little ones.

23:32.150 --> 23:34.030
Listen to this old man.

23:35.350 --> 23:37.640
The consequences of facing the darkness

23:38.440 --> 23:41.070
are beyond what you can bear.

23:43.470 --> 23:44.670
As fate would have it,

23:45.240 --> 23:46.170
we have foreseen

23:46.920 --> 23:48.110
this outcome.

23:48.660 --> 23:49.590
What outcome?

23:51.750 --> 23:53.160
Hongye, come quickly!

23:53.530 --> 23:55.680
We've made it out!

23:55.830 --> 23:57.310
Hongye, come on!

24:00.670 --> 24:01.520
Farewell.

24:19.620 --> 24:20.900
You really came.

24:21.830 --> 24:23.440
Hongye has already breached the Boundary.

24:23.440 --> 24:24.840
Let's get ready to start.

24:26.880 --> 24:28.340
I'll ask you one more time.

24:28.430 --> 24:30.160
Are you sure you want to do this?

24:30.590 --> 24:31.460
Of course.

24:32.390 --> 24:34.720
Are you aware of the consequences of this?

24:35.130 --> 24:37.110
Thank you for your concern, Deputy Chief.

24:37.110 --> 24:39.550
I want to fight alongside Hongye.

24:57.530 --> 24:58.570
They're here.

24:59.250 --> 25:01.110
A bunch of fools.

25:02.110 --> 25:04.240
I will make you understand

25:04.870 --> 25:09.070
that fate cannot be rewritten.

25:23.110 --> 25:24.040
Senior Renfeng.

25:25.240 --> 25:27.770
I heard Miss Huaizhu has gone
on a long journey

25:27.910 --> 25:29.710
and won't be back for a while.

25:30.020 --> 25:30.780
Yes.

25:30.810 --> 25:31.730
Now,

25:32.110 --> 25:34.840
Miss Qinlan is the only one left
in Lanzhu Garden.

25:38.330 --> 25:39.130
Very good.

25:41.210 --> 25:43.170
Everything is under control.

25:44.680 --> 25:45.850
Take this.

25:46.450 --> 25:49.770
Remember to put some into Master's medicine
every day.

25:49.830 --> 25:51.350
Senior Renfeng, this...

25:51.350 --> 25:52.440
Don't worry.

25:53.750 --> 25:57.590
I'll definitely fulfill my promise to you.

26:01.680 --> 26:02.310
Yes.

26:41.790 --> 26:43.310
Zizai, clear the way.

27:33.160 --> 27:33.830
Hongye.

27:34.240 --> 27:35.770
Is that the Black Grief Tree

27:35.830 --> 27:37.760
you've been seeing in your dreams?

27:46.920 --> 27:48.350
Yitan, come with me.

27:48.380 --> 27:50.640
Everyone else, stay alert where you are.

27:50.910 --> 27:52.170
Do not act on your own.

28:39.310 --> 28:41.710
There's a barrier here concealing traces.

29:41.790 --> 29:42.400
Father.

29:42.790 --> 29:43.960
I arrived too late.

29:47.000 --> 29:48.550
My son, Hongye.

29:48.550 --> 29:50.160
Now that the ceremony is complete,

29:50.160 --> 29:51.760
I hope from this day forward,

29:51.830 --> 29:53.830
you'll rein in your wayward nature,

29:53.830 --> 29:55.890
uphold the virtues of our ancestors,

29:55.960 --> 29:58.160
and work towards peace and prosperity.

30:00.930 --> 30:02.130
Please rest assured.

30:03.860 --> 30:05.190
The members and I

30:06.830 --> 30:08.290
will definitely complete

30:09.510 --> 30:11.370
your unfinished journey for you.

31:18.830 --> 31:19.760
They're coming.

31:21.560 --> 31:23.090
Assemble to face the enemy!

32:00.580 --> 32:02.160
Zui, form the formation!

32:17.350 --> 32:18.850
Get them!

32:37.850 --> 32:39.980
Remove chaos, guard clarity.

32:40.660 --> 32:42.560
Black Fox can manipulte people's minds.

32:42.560 --> 32:44.750
We must not leave the formation under any circumstances!

32:44.750 --> 32:47.900
Remove chaos, guard clarity?

32:48.220 --> 32:50.310
The human heart is inherently a quagmire.

32:50.310 --> 32:52.790
How can one possibly guard clarity?

33:08.860 --> 33:10.320
Reinforce the formation!

33:20.230 --> 33:21.080
Break!

33:24.960 --> 33:26.720
Such powerful sword energy.

33:27.510 --> 33:28.570
Black Fox!

33:28.940 --> 33:30.210
Prepare to die

33:30.590 --> 33:32.790
and pay for my father's life with yours!

33:33.190 --> 33:34.510
Is that so?

34:06.510 --> 34:08.159
Foolish humans.

34:08.400 --> 34:11.210
You are so naive.

34:32.780 --> 34:34.980
Wangquan Hongye.

34:35.360 --> 34:38.199
You really overestimate your own abilities,

34:38.440 --> 34:40.670
daring to come here to seek death.

34:44.460 --> 34:45.370
We

34:46.210 --> 34:48.230
are here to kill you.

34:48.889 --> 34:50.989
Such big words.

34:51.480 --> 34:53.250
I'm so scared.

34:55.000 --> 34:56.510
Let me think

34:56.630 --> 34:58.670
how you plan to kill me.

35:47.830 --> 35:50.520
Why does it seem like

35:50.730 --> 35:52.590
all my moves are being seen through?

35:52.590 --> 35:53.800
Is it strange?

35:53.820 --> 35:57.390
Wangquan Hongye, do you think just because
you came prepared,

35:57.550 --> 35:59.580
I should surrender?

35:59.600 --> 36:00.890
How ridiculous.

36:13.570 --> 36:15.530
Wangquan Hongye.

36:15.560 --> 36:17.420
You actually managed to wound me.

36:36.640 --> 36:38.150
Feeling desperate?

36:38.510 --> 36:42.290
With endless hatred, I cannot be killed.

36:42.510 --> 36:44.870
Didn't your father tell you that?

36:46.490 --> 36:47.380
Oh, right.

36:47.430 --> 36:50.090
Your father was also killed by me.

36:52.190 --> 36:52.800
Hongye!

36:55.120 --> 36:57.790
You have no time to worry
about others now.

36:57.850 --> 37:00.360
You'd better worry about yourself.

37:19.840 --> 37:20.970
Is it about to begin?

37:23.320 --> 37:26.150
When Hongye and the others
battle with the Black Fox,

37:26.150 --> 37:29.280
the Black Fox will inevitably absorb
the power of the Grief Tree.

37:29.280 --> 37:32.100
The Grief Tree will wither rapidly.

37:32.280 --> 37:35.320
We must wait until then to make our move.

37:41.630 --> 37:42.630
Hongye,

37:43.700 --> 37:45.260
are you all alright?

37:51.130 --> 37:52.000
Zhang Zheng.

37:53.030 --> 37:53.880
Zhang Zheng!

38:15.150 --> 38:16.120
Qingmu Yuan.

38:16.380 --> 38:17.740
Give up the struggle

38:17.920 --> 38:19.300
and join us.

38:19.400 --> 38:20.800
Who wants to join you?

38:21.000 --> 38:22.830
In the depths of every heart,

38:23.150 --> 38:25.350
who doesn't have a dark forbidden zone?

38:26.000 --> 38:29.150
Darkness is your eternal destination.

38:29.590 --> 38:32.550
Give up your struggle, Qingmu Yuan.

38:32.890 --> 38:33.920
Get lost!
